WEBVTT

00:02:29.395 --> 00:02:32.857
but we haven't always locked up migrants

00:02:32.857 --> 00:02:36.319
who are waiting for the government
to decide their fate.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.821
At one time,

00:02:38.821 --> 00:02:43.951
the United States stood on the verge
of abolishing immigration prisons.

00:02:44.827 --> 00:02:48.831
"This was the sign
of an enlightened civilization,"

00:02:48.873 --> 00:02:52.126
the Supreme Court wrote in 1958.

00:02:53.336 --> 00:02:54.712
We were so close.

00:02:55.338 --> 00:03:01.010
But politics and profits pushed us
in the opposite direction.